    "Mac 会为每台服务器生成专属密钥，经 iCloud 钥匙串同步到这里。请确认两台设备登录同一 Apple ID 并开启 iCloud 钥匙串。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Mac creates a dedicated key for each server and syncs it here through iCloud Keychain. Make sure both devices use the same Apple ID with iCloud Keychain turned on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 会为每台服务器生成专属密钥，经 iCloud 钥匙串同步到这里。请确认两台设备登录同一 Apple ID 并开启 iCloud 钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 暂无数据（休眠或未开启状态中转）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No data from Mac (asleep, or status relay is off)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 暂无数据（休眠或未开启状态中转）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 版用你已有的 ssh 配置连接服务器，并为 iPhone 部署专属只读密钥，经 iCloud 钥匙串端到端加密同步到这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mac app connects with your existing ssh config and deploys a dedicated read-only key for iPhone, synced here end-to-end encrypted through iCloud Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 版用你已有的 ssh 配置连接服务器，并为 iPhone 部署专属只读密钥，经 iCloud 钥匙串端到端加密同步到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 目标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH target"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 目标会原样传给 ssh。推荐使用 ~/.ssh/config 中的 Host 别名，以复用其中的密钥与跳板机配置；需支持免密登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The SSH target is passed to ssh as is. Use a Host alias from ~/.ssh/config to reuse its keys and jump hosts; passwordless login is required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 目标会原样传给 ssh。推荐使用 ~/.ssh/config 中的 Host 别名，以复用其中的密钥与跳板机配置；需支持免密登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 连接失败或恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH connection lost or restored"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 连接失败或恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
