    "ServerKiln 运行时会自动记录，几分钟后即可看到曲线": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ServerKiln records while it runs. Charts appear in a few minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ServerKiln 运行时会自动记录，几分钟后即可看到曲线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ServerKiln 通过系统 ssh 运行只读脚本，沿用 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名、密钥与跳板机。需支持免密登录（密钥或 ssh-agent）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ServerKiln runs a read-only script over the system ssh, reusing the aliases, keys and jump hosts in ~/.ssh/config. Passwordless login (key or ssh-agent) is required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ServerKiln 通过系统 ssh 运行只读脚本，沿用 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名、密钥与跳板机。需支持免密登录（密钥或 ssh-agent）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
