    "「直连」：iPhone 用专属监控密钥直接读取，只能运行只读采集。「中转」：显示 Mac 看到的状态。「终端」：可打开 Shell，每次需 Face ID。在 Mac「设置 → iPhone」中启用、轮换或撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Direct\": iPhone reads with its dedicated monitor key, which can only run the read-only collector. \"Relay\": shows what the Mac sees. \"Terminal\": can open a shell, with Face ID each time. Enable, rotate or revoke in Settings → iPhone on the Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「直连」：iPhone 用专属监控密钥直接读取，只能运行只读采集。「中转」：显示 Mac 看到的状态。「终端」：可打开 Shell，每次需 Face ID。在 Mac「设置 → iPhone」中启用、轮换或撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
