    "主机公钥经已认证连接读取并钉扎，iPhone 不会连接密钥不符的主机。撤销会同时删除服务器上的授权与 iCloud 钥匙串中的私钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "host keys are read over the authenticated connection and pinned, so iPhone never connects to a host whose key doesn't match. Revoking removes both the server's authorization and the private keys in iCloud Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机公钥经已认证连接读取并钉扎，iPhone 不会连接密钥不符的主机。撤销会同时删除服务器上的授权与 iCloud 钥匙串中的私钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
