    "每台服务器每分钟记录一次整体与每张卡的利用率、显存，以及 CPU / 内存。数据保存在本机 ~/Library/Application Support/ServerKiln。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every minute, each server's overall and per-GPU utilization and VRAM plus CPU / memory are recorded locally in ~/Library/Application Support/ServerKiln."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台服务器每分钟记录一次整体与每张卡的利用率、显存，以及 CPU / 内存。数据保存在本机 ~/Library/Application Support/ServerKiln。"
          }
        }
      }
